    "detailed_description": "<i>The Highscore</i> is a non-stop action Shoot \u2018em up with old school graphics in which you have to survive by defeating waves of enemies, accumulate points and reach the highest score possible. But to do so, you can only count on five lives, various powers and your own skill.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055420/extras/0f5d9276a24a381ef481b8fe1b484e71.poster.avif?t=1558369481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055420/extras/0f5d9276a24a381ef481b8fe1b484e71.webm?t=1558369481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055420/extras/0f5d9276a24a381ef481b8fe1b484e71.mp4?t=1558369481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You control a spaceship firing various types of lasers, depending on your progress in the game. Gain more firepower as you kill bosses, and collect special powers to deal more damage or protect yourself from the constant waves of enemies.<br><br><i>The Highscore</i> is a pure arcade game developped around the &quot;Die and Retry&quot; concept. You shoot, you survive and you go as far as you can. When your life drops to zero, the game ends and your score is saved if your total number of points collected during the game exceeds your previous highscore.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>The Highscore</i> is a non-stop action Shoot \u2018em up with old school graphics in which you have to survive by defeating waves of enemies, accumulate points and reach the highest score possible. But to do so, you can only count on five lives, various powers and your own skill.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055420/extras/0f5d9276a24a381ef481b8fe1b484e71.poster.avif?t=1558369481\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055420/extras/0f5d9276a24a381ef481b8fe1b484e71.webm?t=1558369481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1055420/extras/0f5d9276a24a381ef481b8fe1b484e71.mp4?t=1558369481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You control a spaceship firing various types of lasers, depending on your progress in the game. Gain more firepower as you kill bosses, and collect special powers to deal more damage or protect yourself from the constant waves of enemies.<br><br><i>The Highscore</i> is a pure arcade game developped around the &quot;Die and Retry&quot; concept. You shoot, you survive and you go as far as you can. When your life drops to zero, the game ends and your score is saved if your total number of points collected during the game exceeds your previous highscore.",
    "short_description": "The Highscore is a non-stop action Shoot \u2018em up. Survive by defeating waves of enemies, accumulate points, go as far as you can and beat your highscore. But to do so, you can only count on five lives, unique abilities and your own skill.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe Highscore is an intense game to play through, especially with the amount of enemies that are coming for you. Despite it being highly challenging, there is a compelling quality in pushing to go further within the game, facing another boss, and hoping to grab another power-up to keep yourself alive.\u201d<br>IndieGamesPlus<br>",
